GET http://localhost:8080/article
Accept: application/json

### Article by ID
@article_id =9101UB
GET http://localhost:8080/article/{{article_id}}
Accept: application/json

### Get order Allerts
GET http://localhost:8080/order_alerts
Accept: application/json

### Get forecast
POST http://localhost:8080/forecast
Accept: application/json

{
  "article_id": "9101DX",
  "current_stock_for_article": 120,
  "min_stock_for_article": 50
}

### Get most critical alerts
POST http://localhost:8080/alerts
Accept: application/json

{
    "global_current_stock": 10,
    "global_min_stock": 3,
    "amount_of_alerts": 3
}